From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eddy Flores <eddyflores100@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: include emoji reactions in channel history (#47)

When fetching channel history, emoji reactions were missing on
retrieved messages (live messages worked fine). The history fetch
path was using `messages` endpoint without the `with_reactions`
query parameter.

Closes #47.

---
 slidcord/discord/channel.py | 6 +++++-
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/slidcord/discord/channel.py b/slidcord/discord/channel.py
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/slidcord/discord/channel.py
+++ b/slidcord/discord/channel.py
@@ -234,7 +234,11 @@ async def fetch_history(self, limit: int = 50, before: Optional[str] = None):
             params["before"] = before
         if limit:
             params["limit"] = limit
-        msgs = await self.discord.request_json("GET", f"/channels/{self.discord_id}/messages", params=params)
+        msgs = await self.discord.request_json(
+            "GET",
+            f"/channels/{self.discord_id}/messages",
+            params={**params, "with_reactions": True},
+        )
         for msg in msgs:
             reactions = msg.get("reactions", [])
             # Map reaction data to the same shape as live messages
